{
 "language": "en",
 "duration": 108.434,
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.228,
   "text": "Hi, I'm Pablo Arias, founder of International Relocation Partner."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.639,
   "end": 8.217,
   "text": "My team and I have been planning moves abroad for more than 14 years."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.781,
   "end": 12.122,
   "text": "You can book your consultation right here, with the form or in the chat."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.09,
   "end": 16.972,
   "text": "The rules for your move depend on your immigration status and on where you're going."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.709,
   "end": 22.376,
   "text": "Customs can take up to 10 weeks, and a surprise at the port is expensive to fix."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.142,
   "end": 25.529,
   "text": "We start with a 60-minute call about your case."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.81,
   "end": 30.507,
   "text": "Then we build your plan, track each milestone with you, and keep helping after you land."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.349,
   "end": 35.181,
   "text": "We handle international moves, from a single car to a full container."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.856,
   "end": 39.28,
   "text": "In Costa Rica and Panama, we also run private relocation tours,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.434,
   "end": 41.176,
   "text": "so you can see the place before you commit."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.861,
   "end": 44.453,
   "text": "If you'd rather ask first, Lily, our assistant,"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.577,
   "end": 46.578,
   "text": "answers in the chat and can book the call for you."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.972,
   "end": 47.877,
   "text": "She's on WhatsApp too."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.567,
   "end": 51.934,
   "text": "Every successful project starts as a well-planned project,"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.165,
   "end": 53.641,
   "text": "and we built our system around that."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.261,
   "end": 60.702,
   "text": "Your project comes with an online Project Planner that shows the costs, the rules, and the steps, and you accept it right there."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.208,
   "end": 64.129,
   "text": "If the scope changes, we tell you before the bill does."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.708,
   "end": 71.488,
   "text": "Once you confirm, each step goes on a timeline with its dates, documents, and tasks, so you always know what comes next."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.037,
   "end": 75.405,
   "text": "We work with expats and retirees, digital nomads,"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.577,
   "end": 79.689,
   "text": "people looking at opportunities abroad, and people going back to the country they came from."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.308,
   "end": 85.003,
   "text": "Costa Rica, Panama, Mexico, Portugal, Spain, and Colombia."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.485,
   "end": 87.177,
   "text": "Those are the six countries we serve today."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.799,
   "end": 90.653,
   "text": "Jill Reed moved with us, and she tells it better than I could."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.234,
   "end": 93.653,
   "text": "Below her, you'll find what other families wrote on Google."
  },
  {
   "start": 94.28,
   "end": 97.157,
   "text": "The questions people ask us before booking are answered here,"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.431,
   "end": 99.306,
   "text": "and there's a free checklist you can download."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.854,
   "end": 101.767,
   "text": "When you're ready, book your consultation."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.325,
   "end": 103.199,
   "text": "I'll be waiting for you."
  },
  {
   "start": 103.617,
   "end": 105.112,
   "text": "My team and I are waiting for you."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.675,
   "end": 108.252,
   "text": "Sincerely, Pablo Arias, Founder."
  }
 ],
